[{"id":"MTE1-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila <img alt=\"Cu(CN)_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Cu%28CN%29_2\" /> dipanaskan, dihasilkan <img alt=\"C_2N_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_2N_2\" />(cyanogen) dan <img alt=\"CuCN\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CuCN\" />. Berapa massa <img alt=\"Cu(CN)_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Cu%28CN%29_2\" /> dibutuhkan untuk menghasilkan <img alt=\"C_2N_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?C_2N_2\" /> sebanyak 5,00 g? <img alt=\"[Mr Cu(CN)_2=115,6;C_2N_2=52,04]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BMr%20Cu%28CN%29_2%3D115%2C6%3BC_2N_2%3D52%2C04%5D\" /></p>","choices":["20,2 g","22,2 g","24,2 g","26,4 g","28,6 g"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTA4MQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu silinder yang sudah dikosongkan yang isinya 5,00 L diisi dengan gas 25,5 g gas NH3 dan 36,5 g gas HCl. Hitunglah berapa tekanan pada temoeratur <img alt=\"85^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?85%5EoC\" /> sesudaah kedua gas tersebut bereaksi sempurna sesuai reaksi :</p><p><img alt=\"NH_{3(g)} + HCl_{(g)} \\rightarrow NH_4Cl_{(s)}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NH_%7B3%28g%29%7D%20&amp;plus;%20HCl_%7B%28g%29%7D%20%5Crightarrow%20NH_4Cl_%7B%28s%29%7D\" /></p>","choices":["2.94 atm","5.88 atm","8.82 atm","11,76 atm","14.7 atm"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTA4Mg"},{"id":"MTE1-q03","number":3,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Anda mempunyai 3 jenis larutan garam dan 1jenis larutan nonelektrolit yaitu:</p><p>I. <img alt=\"0.13mBaCl_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?0.13mBaCl_2\" /></p><p>II. <img alt=\"0.22mMnSO_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?0.22mMnSO_4\" /></p><p>III. <img alt=\"0.24mZnSO_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?0.24mZnSO_4\" /></p><p>IV. <img alt=\"0.41m\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?0.41m\" /> Ethylene glycol (nonelektrolit)</p><p>Berikut ini, urutan yang benar berdasarkan berkurangnya titik leleh adalah:</p>","choices":["I &gt; II &gt;III &gt;IV","I &gt; IV &gt;II &gt; III","IV &gt; III &gt; II &gt; I","III &gt; II &gt; IV &gt; I","IV &gt; I &gt; III &gt; II"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTA4Mw"},{"id":"MTE1-q04","number":4,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu larutan komposisinya adalah campuran 50%/50% berat air (18 g/mol) dan ethylene glycol (64 g/mol). Ethylene glycol merupakan cairan yang tidak menguap (nonvolatile). Pada temperatur <img alt=\"25^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?25%5EoC\" />. tekanan uap ai murni adalah 23.8 mm Hg. Hitunglah berapa tekanan uap larutan.</p>","choices":["6,68 mmHg","11,90 mmHg","18,6 mmHg","23,8 mmHg","29,74 mmHg"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTA4NA"},{"id":"MTE1-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada atom atau ion berikut ini, manakah yang mengandung paling banyak elektron yang tak-berpasangan:</p>","choices":["F","N","<img alt=\"S2^-\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?S2%5E-\" />","<img alt=\"Sc3^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Sc3%5E&amp;plus;\" />","<img alt=\"Ti3^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ti3%5E&amp;plus;\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTA4NQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q06","number":6,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>A. Atom atau ion berikut ini, Ar, <img alt=\"K^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K%5E&amp;plus;\" /> dan <img alt=\"Ca2^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ca2%5E&amp;plus;\" />+ adalah isoelektronik (mempunyai jumlah elektron sama). Dari pernyataan berikut ini, manakah urutan kenaikan jari-jari benar?</p><p><em>Terkecil&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </em>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<em>terbesar</em></p><p><img alt=\"Ar\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ar\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"Ca2^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ca2%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"K^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K%5E&amp;plus;\" /></p><p><img alt=\"Ar\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ar\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"K^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"Ca^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ca%5E&amp;plus;\" /></p><p><img alt=\"Ca2^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ca2%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"Ar\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ar\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"K^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K%5E&amp;plus;\" /></p><p><img alt=\"Ca2^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ca2%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"K^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"Ar\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ar\" /></p><p><img alt=\"K^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?K%5E&amp;plus;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"Ar\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ar\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"Ca2^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?Ca2%5E&amp;plus;\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTA4Ng"},{"id":"MTE1-q07","number":7,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Diantara molekul berikut ini, manakah yang merupakan contoh molekul dengan ikatan kovalen 100%?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_2O\" />","<img alt=\"\\small KOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20KOH\" />","<img alt=\"\\small HCl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20HCl\" />","<img alt=\"\\small O_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20O_2\" />","Tidak ada molekul yang 100 % ikatan kovalen"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwMA"},{"id":"MTE1-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berdasarkan kecenderungan keelektronegatifan masing masing unsur yang berikatan, berikut ini manakah ikatan yang paling polar?</p>","choices":["N&mdash;O","C&mdash;N","Si&mdash;F","P&mdash;S","B&mdash;C"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwMQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Apa geometri dari untuk molekul dengan jumlah pasangan elektron pada atom pusat masing masing 4 pasang, 3 pasang dan 2 pasang elektron?</p>","choices":["tetrahedral, trigonal planar, linear","tetrahedral, trigonal piramidal, linear","tetrahedral, trigonal planar, bengkok","pyramidal, trigonal planar, linear.","bukan salah satu jawaban diatas"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwMg"},{"id":"MTE1-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari reaksi reaksi ammonia berikut ini, manakah yang tidak melibatkan pasangan elektron non-ikatan (non-bonding) pada atom nitrogen?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small NH_3(g) + H_2O(l) \\rightarrow NH ^+(aq)+ OH^-(aq)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_3%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20H_2O%28l%29%20%5Crightarrow%20NH%20%5E&amp;plus;%28aq%29&amp;plus;%20OH%5E-%28aq%29\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NH_3(g) + CH_3I(g) \\rightarrow CH3NH^+I^-(s)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_3%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20CH_3I%28g%29%20%5Crightarrow%20CH3NH%5E&amp;plus;I%5E-%28s%29\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NH_3(g) + HCl(g) \\rightarrow NH_4Cl(s)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_3%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20HCl%28g%29%20%5Crightarrow%20NH_4Cl%28s%29\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 2NH_3(l) + 2Na(s) \\rightarrow 2NaNH_2(s) + H_2(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202NH_3%28l%29%20&amp;plus;%202Na%28s%29%20%5Crightarrow%202NaNH_2%28s%29%20&amp;plus;%20H_2%28g%29\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 2NH_3(g) + Ag^+(aq) \\rightarrow Ag(NH_3)_2^+(aq)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202NH_3%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20Ag%5E&amp;plus;%28aq%29%20%5Crightarrow%20Ag%28NH_3%29_2%5E&amp;plus;%28aq%29\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwMw"},{"id":"MTE1-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini, manakah pasangan yang mengandung oksida basa, oksida asam dan oksida amfoter?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415054946.PNG\" style=\"height:94px; width:149px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwNA"},{"id":"MTE1-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diantara isomer senyawa hidrokarbon berikut ini, manakah yang lebih mungkin mempunyai tekanan uap paling rendah?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415055035.PNG\" style=\"height:94px; width:177px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwNQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini adalah Tabel tingkat oksidasi yang mungkin dari lima unsur blok-<em>d </em>(unsur dinyatakan sebagai huruf , bukan symbol unsur)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415055146.PNG\" />Berdasarkan kemungkinan tingkat oksidasi unsur unsur tersebut, berikut ini manakah ion yang paling mungkin keberadaannya?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415060259.PNG\" style=\"height:87px; width:59px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwNg"},{"id":"MTE1-q14","number":14,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sebanyak 30 mL larutan <img alt=\"\\small 0,10 mol/L Ba(OH)_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%200%2C10%20mol/L%20Ba%28OH%29_2\" /> ditambahkan ke dalam 30 mL larutan <img alt=\"\\small 0,10 mol/L H_2SO_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%200%2C10%20mol/L%20H_2SO_4\" />. Setelah diampurkan, terjadi kenaikan temperatur sebesar <img alt=\"\\small \\Delta T_1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5CDelta%20T_1\" />. Percobaan ini kemudian diulang dengan mencampurkan larutan yang sama, tetapi mengunakan</p><p>volume masing masing campuran sebanyak 90 mL dari larutan yang sama, dan terjadi kenaikan temperatur sebesar <img alt=\"\\small \\Delta T_2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5CDelta%20T_2\" />. Berikut ini manakah persamaan yang benar mengenai kenaikan temperatur kedua campuran tersebut?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small \\Delta T_2 = \\Delta T_1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5CDelta%20T_2%20%3D%20%5CDelta%20T_1\" />","<img alt=\"\\small \\Delta T_2 = 3 . \\Delta T_1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5CDelta%20T_2%20%3D%203%20.%20%5CDelta%20T_1\" />","<img alt=\"\\small \\Delta T_2 = 6 . \\Delta T_1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5CDelta%20T_2%20%3D%206%20.%20%5CDelta%20T_1\" />","<img alt=\"\\small \\Delta T2 = 1/3 . \\Delta T1\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5CDelta%20T2%20%3D%201/3%20.%20%5CDelta%20T1\" />.","Tidak dapat ditentukan."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwNw"},{"id":"MTE1-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi berikut ini: <img alt=\"\\small 4NH_3 + 7O_2 \\: \\square \\: 4NO_2 + 6H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%204NH_3%20&amp;plus;%207O_2%20%5C%3A%20%5Csquare%20%5C%3A%204NO_2%20&amp;plus;%206H_2O\" /></p><p>Pada saat tertentu, laju awal hilangnya gas oksigen adalah X. Pada saat yang sama, berapa nilai laju awal munculnya air?</p>","choices":["1.2 X","1.1 X","0.86 X","0.58 X","tidak dapat ditentukan dari data yang tak lengkap"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwOA"},{"id":"MTE1-q16","number":16,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Penguraian gas Nitryl chloride menghasilkan gas nitrogen dioksida dan gas chlor sesuai reaksi:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415060925.PNG\" style=\"height:153px; width:500px\" /></p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small 2NO_2Cl(g) \\rightarrow 2 NO_2(g) + Cl_2 (g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202NO_2Cl%28g%29%20%5Crightarrow%202%20NO_2%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20Cl_2%20%28g%29\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NO_2Cl(g) \\rightarrow NO(g) + ClO (g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NO_2Cl%28g%29%20%5Crightarrow%20NO%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20ClO%20%28g%29\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 2 NO_2Cl(g) \\rightarrow 2 NO_2(g) + 2ClO (g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%20NO_2Cl%28g%29%20%5Crightarrow%202%20NO_2%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%202ClO%20%28g%29\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NO_2Cl(g) \\rightarrow NO_2(g) + Cl(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NO_2Cl%28g%29%20%5Crightarrow%20NO_2%28g%29%20&amp;plus;%20Cl%28g%29\" />","Semua usulan mekanisme diatas dapat diterima</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEwOQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q17","number":17,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan reaksi: <img alt=\"\\small 2 NO_{(g)} + Cl_{2(g)} \\rightarrow 2 NOCl.\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202%20NO_%7B%28g%29%7D%20&amp;plus;%20Cl_%7B2%28g%29%7D%20%5Crightarrow%202%20NOCl.\" /></p><p>Berikut ini, manakah pernyataan yang tepat agar supaya reaksi antara molekul NO dan Cl2 dapat berhasil?</p><p>I . Orientasi yang sesuai (tepat)</p><p>II. Perbandingan NO/Cl2 adalah 2 : 1 III Energi tumbukan yang cukup.</p>","choices":["Hanya I","Hanya I dan II","Hanya I dan III","Hanya II dan III","I, II, dan III"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExMA"},{"id":"MTE1-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pada temperatur <img alt=\"25^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?25%5EoC\" />, berapa konsentrasi <img alt=\"[H^+]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BH%5E&amp;plus;%5D\" /> dalam larutan yang mengandung <img alt=\"[OH^-]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5BOH%5E-%5D\" />&nbsp;= <img alt=\"\\small 3.99X10^{-5} M?\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203.99X10%5E%7B-5%7D%20M%3F\" /></p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small 3.99X10^{-5} M?\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203.99X10%5E%7B-5%7D%20M%3F\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 1.00 X 10^{-7}M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%201.00%20X%2010%5E%7B-7%7DM\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 1.00 X 10^{-14} M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%201.00%20X%2010%5E%7B-14%7D%20M\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 2.51X10^{-10} M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%202.51X10%5E%7B-10%7D%20M\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 3.99 X 10^9 M\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203.99%20X%2010%5E9%20M\" />."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExMQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini, manakah anion asamnya (basa konyugasinya) memberikan sifat basa yang paling kuat?</p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small HSO_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20HSO_4\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small CI^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CI%5E&amp;plus;\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small C_2H_3O_2 (Ion\\:asetat)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20C_2H_3O_2%20%28Ion%5C%3Aasetat%29\" />","&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small NO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NO_3\" />","Semuanya adalah basa konyugasi dari asam kuat dan mempunyai kekutan yang sama."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExMg"},{"id":"MTE1-q20","number":20,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Kolam renang umum sering diklorinasi untuk membunuh bakteri. Sebagai alternatif untuk klorinasi, ion perak dapat dipakai dalam konsentrasi dari tidak lebih dari 10-6 mol L-1 dan tidak kurang dari 10-7 mol L-1. Semua larutan garam senyawa berikut ini adalah larutan jenuh. Diantara larutan tersebut, manakah larutan yang dapat mengkasilkan konsentrasi ion perak yang dibutuhkan?.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415042126.PNG\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExMw"},{"id":"MTE1-q21","number":21,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bahan pembakar padat untuk pendorong roket pesawat luar angkasa terdiri dari campuran aluminium dan senyawa X. Senyawa X adalah senyawa yang mengandung chlor dengan tingkat oksidasi +7.</p><p>Berikut ini, manakah yang merupakan senyawa X?.</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"NCl_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?NCl_3\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NH_4Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_4Cl\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NH_4ClO_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_4ClO_3\" />","<img alt=\"\\small NH_4ClO_4\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20NH_4ClO_4\" />","<img alt=\"\\small N_2H_5Cl\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20N_2H_5Cl\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExNA"},{"id":"MTE1-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini diberikan potensial reduksi setengah sel:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415042634.PNG\" /></p><p>Berdasarkan potensial setengah sel tersebut, berikut ini manakah pernyataan yang benar?</p><p>I. Magnesium adalah reduktor lebih baik</p><p>II. Dalam keadaan standar, reaksi akan terjadi secara spontan bila setengah sel (2) digabung dengan setengah sel hidrogen.</p><p>III.&nbsp;Bila logam tembaga ditambahkan ke larutan AgNO3, logam perak akan mengendap</p><p>IV. Jika&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415042803.PNG\" /></p>","choices":["I dan II","II dan III","I, II dan III","I, III dan IV","I, II dan IV."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExNQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q23","number":23,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini adalah senyawa alkohol. Bila dilakukan test-Iodoform (I2/NaOH) terhadap semua senyawa alkohol tersebut, manakah yang memberikan hasil yang positif?.</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small (CH_3)_2COH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%28CH_3%29_2COH\" />","<img alt=\"\\small (C_2H_5)_2CHOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%28C_2H_5%29_2CHOH\" />","<img alt=\"\\small CH_3CH_2COH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3CH_2COH\" />","<img alt=\"\\small CH_3CH_2OH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3CH_2OH\" />","<img alt=\"\\small C_6H_5CHOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20C_6H_5CHOH\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExNg"},{"id":"MTE1-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa propenaldehida dioksidasi dengan KMnO4 pada temperature ruang. Apa produk reaksi yang terbentuk ?.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415043216.PNG\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExNw"},{"id":"MTE1-q25","number":25,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di dalam pelarut air, senyawa senyawa fenol bersifat sebagai asam lemah. Diantara senyawa fenol berikut ini, manakah yang mempunyai sifat asam paling kuat (paling asam) ?</p><p>A. Fenol</p><p><em>B. m</em>-aminofenol</p><p><em>C. p</em>-metilfenol</p><p><em>D. p</em>-nitrofenol</p><p><em>E. p</em>-aminofenol.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExOA"},{"id":"MTE1-q26","number":26,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam senyawa organik berikut ini, gugus fungsi apa saja yang terdapat didalamnya?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415043408.PNG\" /></p>","choices":["ester, aldehida, alkena","alkena, ester, keton","aldehida, asam karboksilat, ester","asam karboksilat, keton, alkena","alkena, ester, asam karboksilat."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTExOQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa formaldehida direaksikan dengan metil magnesium bromida dan kemudian dihidrolisa dalam suasana asam. Produk yang dihasilkan dari reaksi tersebut adalah:</p><p>A. 2-propanol</p><p><em>B. n</em>-propanol</p><p>C. propanaldehida</p><p>D. aseton</p><p>E. Etanol.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEyMA"},{"id":"MTE1-q28","number":28,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Nilon-6 adalah suatu polimer organik yang mengandung unsur C, H dan N yang mempunyai rumus molekul sebagai berikut:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415053450.PNG\" /></p><p>Dalam suasana asam, senyawa polimer ini akan mengalami hidrolisis. Produk yang dihasilkan dari hidrolisis polimer nilon-6 ini adalah:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415053544.PNG\" />.</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEyMQ"},{"id":"MTE1-q29","number":29,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu senyawa 2-metil butana direaksikan dengan Br2, hv&nbsp;(energi cahaya) pada temperatur <img alt=\"\\small 125^oC\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20125%5EoC\" />. Produk utama yang dihasilkan dari reaksi tersebut adalah:</p>","choices":["3-metil-2-bromo butana","1,2-dibromo butana","2-metil-2-bromo butana","3-metil-1-bromo butana","2-metil-1-bromo butana."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEyMg"},{"id":"MTE1-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dari lima senyawa organik berikut ini, tunjukkan mana senyawa yang mempunyai isomer <em>cis </em>dan <em>trans </em>?.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200415053756.PNG\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NTEyMw"}]
